B.anP=new A.cQ("source_innate","Innate","The character can use the ability as much as they like, using a Source value of {Half Power}. If the feature only has the innate source gain +1 to the source value.","If you only have innate as your only source, gain +1 to skill results.","Next scene gain +1 to skills you're proficient in, or next situation start with {Power + Level} shield.","You have -1 to attacks and proficient skills.","{Half Power}",B.Hk,!1,null,null,B.S,B.S,null)
B.Hn=new A.nu(5,"minion")
B.aoy=new A.bB("Pawns","Instead of a normal chump, you have {Their Vitality} Pawns with 1 HP each. Whenever they gain shield they gain 1 shield, blocking 1 attack. If they have spectral or gain Resistance to all, they instead have 2 HP.",B.S,!1)
B.aov=new A.bB("Melee","HP {4 * Level * Their Vitality}. [Minion] Make a Melee Attack vs Str targeting 1 enemy range 1. On Success, deal {Half points d8} damage.",B.S,!1)
B.aod=new A.bB("Range","HP {3 * Level * Their Vitality}. [Minion] Make a Ranged Attack vs Dex targeting 1 enemy range 6/12. On Success, deal {Half points d6} damage.",B.S,!1)
B.aob=new A.bB("Repair","HP {2 * Level * Their Vitality}. Repair [Minion] Make a status check targeting an adjacent Ally. On Success: Heal {Half points d8}.",B.S,!1)
B.aoJ=new A.bB("Shielding","HP {2 * Level * Their Vitality}. Shield [Minion] Make a status check targeting a range 1 ally. On success, they gain {Half points d6} shield.",B.S,!1)
B.aou=new A.bB("Familiar","HP {3 * Level * Their Vitality}. [Minion] You may target your abilities and skills from your minion's space. When you do, gain a +1 to the result of attacks, skills or status checks.",B.S,!1)
B.a9R=s([B.aoy,B.aov,B.aod,B.aob,B.aoJ,B.aou],t.AJ)
B.anM=new A.cQ("source_companion","Companion","Your Companion is another character who takes their turn at the same time as you. When you trigger abilities of this source, your companion performs the ability using their stats with a source value of {Half Level}. If you do not trigger an ability of this source using your [Action] on your turn, your companion may trigger their [Minion] ability. You may have multiple companions with dm approval, treating each as a separate source.\nWhen you gain a companion, build a chump of your level but without a chump action, or combat features. Your companion has a Body Composition and Body Size but doesn't gain any bonuses related to the Body Composition or Body Size. Pick one of the below companion options, which changes the companion's Max HP.\nCompanions do not have turns but act during your turn. Companions are characters for the purposes of effects. Companions have reactions, and can concentrate. They may move up to their speed on each of your turns. If you perform a [Run] or [Retreat] your companions also take the action.","When you fail a skill or defense check, you may have your companion make the check instead. You may do this {points} times per Story.","Your companion starts next situation with {Level * Their Vitality} Shield.","Your companion has a -1 to check results.","{Half Level}",B.Hn,!1,null,null,B.a9R,B.S,"{1}")
B.qF=new A.nu(7,"inventory")
B.aol=new A.bB("Huckable","Increase range of abilities by {Level/3}",B.S,!1)
B.ao2=new A.bB("Dangerous","Target all characters range 1 of any of the targets and deal {Level/3 d6} damage to them.",B.S,!1)
B.aoq=new A.bB("Dampening","Target all enemies range {Level/3} of any of the targets and reduce their shields by {Level/3 d6}.",B.S,!1)
B.ao1=new A.bB("Energizing","Target all Allies range {Level/3} of any of the targets and they gain {Level/3} speed until the end of their next turn.",B.S,!1)
B.ao9=new A.bB("Empowering","Allies targeted by the ability deal {Level/3} d6 extra damage on their first attack they succeed on each turn.",B.S,!1)
B.aom=new A.bB("Protective","Target all allies range {Level/3} of any of the targets and give them {Level/3 d6} shields.",B.S,!1)
B.aoC=new A.bB("Regenerative","Target all allies range 1 of any of the targets and heal them {Level/3 d10}.",B.S,!1)
B.aok=new A.bB("Unstable","Before using the ability make a create check, on success gain a source mod of 1, on failure lose health equal to your create level.",B.S,!1)
