B.anQ=new A.cQ("source_craft","Craft","The character gains their powers from consumable creations that they make during combat. At the start of your turn, make a create check, on success gain 1 ingredient. When using an ability, the character must spend 1 ingredient, gaining its effects and a source of {Power}. For every 4 points of this source, the character gains 1 ingredient type from below, minimum 1. Whenever you spend an ingredient, the ingredient's type effect is added to the ability's effect. If the ability requires success, the effect only occurs if you succeed. You start each encounter with 1 ingredient of each type you know. You may create with 1 free hand. You cannot concentrate on the abilities of this source. When an ability would call for concentration, instead make a status check on the start of each of the target\u2019s turns, on failure the effect ends for the target.\n[Action] gain {Half Power} ingredients of your choice.\n[Reaction] When you fail a status effect check against a target within range 6, spend your reaction and an ingredient to cause the check to succeed instead.","After you succeed on a skill check, gain 1 craft and pick a skill check. You and your allies can use the craft to gain advantage on that type of check. You may do this up to {points} times each Story. You do not gain crafts for a check in which you used a craft.","Start the next situation with 2 ingredients of each type you know and have a +1 to create checks to create ingredients.","You start the next situation with no starting ingredients and have a -1 to create checks to create ingredients.","{Power}",B.qF,!1,null,null,B.aad,B.S,"{points / 4}")
B.qE=new A.nu(6,"transformation")
B.ao8=new A.bB("Melee","When you Succeed on an attack or check using your action, target an enemy range 1 and deal {points /2 d12} Damage.",B.S,!1)
B.aoI=new A.bB("Ranged","When you Succeed on an attack or check using your action, target an enemy range 4 and deal {points /2 d10} Damage.",B.S,!1)
B.aog=new A.bB("Elusive","When you Succeed on an attack or check using your action, Your movement doesn\u2019t provoke attacks and you gain {points /2} Speed until the end of your turn.",B.S,!1)
B.ao6=new A.bB("Barrier","When you Succeed on an attack or check using your action, Gain {points /2 d10} Shield and until the start of your next turn, allies range 2 may spend your shield when taking damage. On Problems, allies range 2 may spend your shield when taking damage until the start of your next turn.",B.S,!1)
B.aoF=new A.bB("Regenerative","When you Succeed on an attack or check using your action, Heal {points /2 d6}.",B.S,!1)
B.aoh=new A.bB("Armored","When you Succeed on an attack or check using your action, Gain a +1 to defense results and resistance to {points /3} defenses until the start of your next turn. When you pick this, pick the defenses. On Problems, you gain only the resistances.",B.S,!1)
B.a8T=s([B.ao8,B.aoI,B.aog,B.ao6,B.aoF,B.aoh],t.AJ)
B.anO=new A.cQ("source_form","Form","The character gains their power through altering their form. Once per situation, you transform into your alternate form before you activate one of your form source powers and remain changed as long as you are concentrating. You may only use this source when concentrating on your form, using a source value of {Power}. While in a form, you may concentrate on up to {Power} additional effects. When you lose concentration on your form, you lose concentration on these additional effects.\nWhen you choose this, pick a new body size, composition and defense class which replace your character's while in the form. When you pick your form, pick one of the below effects.\nYou may have multiple different forms, each different form is considered a separate source, Having its own usage and only being activatable when in the corresponding form. You may be concentrating on multiple forms at the same time, at the start of your turn select one of your forms to use its size, composition and defense class until your next turn. When concentrating on multiple forms, you may use any of those forms abilities regardless of which forms size you select. When concentrating on multiple forms, your extra forms do not grant you the ability to concentrate on extra effects per form.","When you pick this, choose different skill proficiencies for your form. You enter your form for the rest of the scene {Half points} times per Story, gaining one of the below effects.\nTerrifying: When you Succeed on an attack, or succeed a check to harm or destroy things, cause nearby civilians to flee in terror.\nLurking: If you haven't been seen in your form, you have advantage on conceal checks. Otherwise you gain +1 to conceal.\nAlluring: You have a +1 to convince results.","Next situation, you have advantage on concentrating on your form.","Next situation, you have disadvantage on concentrating on your form.","{Power}",B.qE,!1,null,null,B.a8T,B.S,"{1}")
B.anV=new A.cQ("source_gadgets","Gadgets","The character gains their powers from created objects. Every combat feature is a unique object or a part in another unique object, that can appear as anything but has the properties of a single Implement selected when you take the feature. When you use the gadget, you have a source value of {Power + 1}. You may use the gadget once, then you must fix the gadget to use it again. If multiple features are in the same object, each feature can be used and fixed independently.\nFix: [Action] fix all of your Gadgets.\nJerryRig: [Reaction] During your or allies turn, you may spend your reaction and fix 1 gadget.","For each of your gadgets, You may gain advantage or +1 on results on a skill check. You may not do this again with this gadget until you either make a skill check with disadvantage or -1 to results.","Choose 1 of your gadgets and the first time you activate it in the next situation, you don't need to fix it.","Randomly choose 1 of your gadgets; it starts the next situation requiring a fix before you can use it.","{Power + 1}",B.qF,!1,null,null,B.S,B.S,null)
B.anZ=new A.cQ("source_granted_power","Granted Power","The character gets their features from a powerful entity. They may use their powers {2 * points} times per story. They regain all uses after each story. Your source value is {Power + 1}. Abilities of this source require the use of an implement.","You have {2 * points} blessings per Story. When you fail a skill check, you may pay 1 blessing to reroll. At the end of a situation or combat encounter, regain all your blessings.","Regain {points / 2} granted power usages.","Whenever you use a granted power usage, make a Vit defense; on problems suffer {vitality d6} damage.","{Power + 1}",B.Hk,!0,null,null,B.S,B.S,null)
