B.a_6=new A.am("feature_inspiration","Inspiration","Inspire [Reaction]: After you or an ally you see succeeds on a check or attack during their turn, target {Source} allies and give them an Inspiration. When they would make an attack, defense, or skill roll, they may spend the inspiration to gain advantage. All inspiration is lost at the end of the situation.\n\nInspiring Valor [Action]: Make either a Melee Attack vs Str range 1 or a Ranged Attack vs Dex range 4. On Success, deal {Source d6} damage to an enemy in range and all allies range {Source} gain shield equal to half the damage you deal.",B.az,B.a9W,!1)
