B.TE=new A.r("feature_tower_Escape_Pods","Escape Pods","When the Tower is Destroyed, you or allies inside may immediately dash to a free space within {Source} instead of making a Dex defense. After you succeed with your reaction status check, dash to a free space within {Source}.")
B.Z2=new A.r("feature_tower_Sniper_Nest","Sniper's Nest","While in the tower, making attacks at long range doesn\u2019t impose disadvantage when attacking.")
B.Tz=new A.r("feature_tower_Rigged_To_Blow","Rigged To Blow","When the tower is destroyed, Target each enemy range 2 of the tower and make a Status Check vs Dex. On Success, deal {Source d8} damage.")
B.a8S=s([B.TE,B.Z2,B.Tz],t.U)
B.ZN=new A.am("feature_tower","Tower","[Action] Create a Wall as if you had used a skill. As long as the wall remains, you and your allies may enter the wall, and gain a {half Source} bonus to range while inside. Creatures inside may not be targeted by attacks from enemies within {Half Source} of the tower, but such enemies can still attack the tower itself. When the tower is destroyed, creatures inside must make a Dex defense or fall prone.\n\n[Reaction] After you succeed on a Melee Attack, spend your reaction and Trap one of the targets in a Tower that is a wall created as if you had used a skill. The target is restrained as long as the tower remains, cannot use reactions, and cannot target anything but the tower and has disadvantage on attacks against the tower.",B.az,B.a8S,!1)
B.V9=new A.r("feature_the_end_Angelic_Rally","Angelic Rally","On Success, target {Half source} allies in the situation and heal them {Source d6}.")
B.XK=new A.r("feature_the_end_Martyr","Martyr","On Success, you may increase the damage to {Source d12} and you are also targeted. The damage against you ignores your resistance and shield.")
B.Ww=new A.r("feature_the_end_Retribution","Retribution","On Success, until the start of your next turn [Reaction] when the target damages one of your allies, you may spend your reaction to give the ally resistance to the damage and make a status check vs Cha. On success deal {Source d6} damage.")
B.aca=s([B.V9,B.XK,B.Ww],t.U)
B.a_F=new A.am("feature_the_end","The End","[Action] Make a Ranged Attack vs Cha targeting {Half Source} enemies in the situation. On Success, Deal {Source d6} Damage. \n\n[Reaction] At the end of the round, Spend your reaction and all characters in the combat take {Half Source d6} damage vs Cha.\n",B.K,B.aca,!1)
B.WV=new A.r("feature_thorns_Root","Root","As long as you are concentrating on thorns, At the end of the target\u2019s turn, if the target hasn't moved on their turn, the thorns grow 1 space outward up to {1 + Source}. If an enemy makes any Attack in the thorn growth, they take the damage. Whenever the target moves or dashes they lose the roots. ")
B.Xc=new A.r("feature_thorns_Burs","Burs","After an enemy takes damage from your thorns, make an Status Check vs Wis, On a Success, the target has Burs, reducing their speed by {half Source}. On the Start of the target\u2019s turn, repeat the Status Check, On Success, deal {Source d6} damage and if you Miss, the effect ends.")
B.XO=new A.r("feature_thorns_Blood_Rose","Blood Rose","Whenever your thorns deal damage to an enemy, heal the attacked target of your thorns equal to the damage dealt by the thorns.")
B.a7Q=s([B.WV,B.Xc,B.XO],t.U)
B.ZX=new A.am("feature_thorns","Thorns","[Action] Target a creature range 1. As long as you are concentrating, the target gains Resistance to damage from Melee Attacks. When the target succeeds on a defense caused by a Melee Attack, deal {Half Source d6} damage to the attacker. While concentrating, if you activate the ability again, you may add the new targets to your current concentration.\n\n[Reaction] During your turn, spend your reaction and trigger your thorns action.\n\n[Reaction] After an ally Succeeds on a Defense from a Melee Attack, spend your reaction and deal {half Source d8} damage vs Wis.",B.az,B.a7Q,!1)
B.UL=new A.r("feature_throw_Counter_Throw","Counter Throw","Passive: When making an attack of opportunity, you may use your Throw action instead.")
B.VJ=new A.r("feature_throw_Bounce_Off","Bounce Off","If you could throw the target onto an obstacle or into a wall, place them adjacent to it and deal {Source d6} extra damage.")
B.Vh=new A.r("feature_throw_Hold_on","Hold on","On Success, You may throw the target to a free space within {Source} then you dash to a free space adjacent to the target.")
B.a9X=s([B.UL,B.VJ,B.Vh],t.U)
B.a_T=new A.am("feature_throw","Throw","[Action: 1 Unarmed]: Make a Melee Attack vs Str targeting an enemy within 1, who is no more than 1 size bigger than you: On a Success, you may throw them to a free space within {2*Source} of you and deal {Source d10} Damage. When you throw an ally, they may make a Finesse to ignore the damage, otherwise they take half damage.\n\n[Reaction] When you succeed a defense against a melee attack, or an ally succeeds a defense against an enemy who is range 1 of you, spend your reaction, and if the target is no more than 1 size larger than you, dash them into a free space within {2*Source} and deal {Half Source d6} damage vs Str.",B.K,B.a9X,!1)
B.WR=new A.r("feature_tornado_debris","Debris","Each time you move the tornado using your reaction, increase the damage it does by 1d12 up to max of {Power d12}.")
B.Z0=new A.r("feature_tornado_hurling","Hurling","Whenever you force a target to dash, dash them {Source} instead. When you target an ally and succeed, dash them {2 * Source} instead.")
B.TF=new A.r("feature_tornado_wind_step","Wind Step","When you succeed in targeting yourself or an ally, they gain {Half Source} bonus speed and a +1 to defenses from Ranged Attacks until the end of their next turn.")
B.a8Y=s([B.WR,B.Z0,B.TF],t.U)
B.ZS=new A.am("feature_tornado","Tornado","[Action] Target a 2 space radius within 6, and make a Ranged Attack vs Wis. On Success, deal {Source d6} damage to enemies there and dash all characters in the tornado to a free space within {Half Source}. Create a tornado there for as long as you remain concentrating. When a character starts its turn in the tornado, or enters it for the first time during their turn, make a Status Check vs Wis, On Success Deal {Half Source d6}, knock the target prone, and dash the target to a free space with {Half Source}. When you or allies enter, On success, they take no damage and aren\u2019t knocked prone, on Problems, they are affected as if you succeed against an enemy.\n\n[Reaction] During your turn while concentrating, Spend your reaction to move your tornado {Source} spaces. For each creature that the tornado passes over, make the status check against them, targeting no creature more than once.  ",B.K,B.a8Y,!1)
B.Xl=new A.r("feature_tribal_elder_Sage","Sage","After using Treatment Advice or as a [Reaction] during your turn, you may begin concentrating on sage. While concentrating sage reduce your speed by {Half Source}, and allies within {Source} of you get a +1 bonus to defense results.")
B.Vx=new A.r("feature_tribal_elder_Surgeon","Surgeon","When you succeed on coordinated Aid, you end any burn or bleed the target has, if they had none heal {Source d12} instead. After using Treatment Advice, if the target had burn or bleed, make a status check and on success end the burn or bleed. If both or multiple different burns you may only end 1 effect.")
B.Uy=new A.r("feature_tribal_elder_Teacher","Teacher","Allies within {Half Source} of you gain +1 to Coordinated Aid Status Checks. After you use Coordinate Aid, Until the start of your next turn, allies range {Source} of you may spend their [Reaction] during their turn or any allies turn to Target 1 ally range 1 and make a status check. On Success, they heal the target {Targets vitality d6} or give the target the same amount of shield. They may target themselves, but must make the check with disadvantage.")
B.ad2=s([B.Xl,B.Vx,B.Uy],t.U)
B.ZW=new A.am("feature_tribal_elder","Tribal Elder","Coordinated Aid [Action]: Target {Half Source} allies range 6 and each target may choose 1 ally range 1 and make a status check. On success, either Heal the ally {Source d6} or grant them {Source d6} shield, healers choice. You may target yourself. A target may heal themselves but must make the status check with disadvantage.\n\nTreatment Advice: [Reaction] When an ally range {Source} fails a defense against a status check, spend your reaction, and the target rerolls the check with a +1 to results.\n",B.az,B.ad2,!1)
B.X2=new A.r("feature_tribal_gatherer_Hold_this","Hold this","After using any [Reaction] that triggers because an ally, the ally may give you any item they are carrying.")
B.Wg=new A.r("feature_tribal_gatherer_Nomadic","Nomadic","After using Coordinated Movement, Retreat, or Work, At the end of the round, you and allies range {Source} may move up to {Source}.")
B.Wd=new A.r("feature_tribal_gatherer_Communication","Communication","When you use Coordinated Work, each ally in range also gains 1 reroll for that same skill. ")
B.aal=s([B.X2,B.Wg,B.Wd],t.U)
B.a_p=new A.am("feature_tribal_gatherer","Tribal Gatherer","Coordinated Movement [Reaction]: When you or an ally you can see Uses [Run], you may spend your reaction, you and allies range {Source} may immediately move up to their speed.\n\nCoordinated Retreat: [Reaction] When you or an ally you can see Uses [Retreat], you may spend your reaction, you and allies range {Source} may immediately move up to half their speed without provoking.\n\nCoordinated Work [Reaction]: When an ally range {Source} uses an action to make a skill check, you may spend your reaction, to give them 1 reroll and 1 additional reroll per ally within {Half Source} of the target. These rerolls can only be used on that specific skill and last until the end of the situation.\n",B.az,B.aal,!1)
B.V1=new A.r("feature_tribal_hunter_Packhunter","Packhunter","Until the start of your next turn, allies who attack targeted enemies increase their damage by {Half Source d6}.")
B.Xe=new A.r("feature_tribal_hunter_Leader_of_the_Hunt","Leader of the Hunt","After Coordinated Strike or Joint Strike, Until the start of your next turn, allies within {source} spaces of you have +1 to attack results.")
B.V6=new A.r("feature_tribal_hunter_Gather_and_Prepare","Gather and Prepare","[Action] You and all Allies range {source} may move up to {source} spaces, then may make a conceal check to hide. Until the end of your next turn, you and your allies have a +1 to Coordinated Strike attack results.")
B.acK=s([B.V1,B.Xe,B.V6],t.U)
B.a_Q=new A.am("feature_tribal_hunter","Tribal Hunter","Coordinated Strike [Action]: You and {Source/3} allies range 6 make either a Ranged Attack vs Dex Range 6 or Melee Attack vs Str range 1 targeting one enemy, on success deal {Source d6} damage for Ranged, and {Source d8} for melee. Each attacker chooses range or melee individually.\n\nJoint Strike [Reaction] Before an Ally you can see makes an attack during their turn, Spend your reaction and give the ally a +1 to the attack result. If they succeed, If the attack was Melee, target an enemy range 1, and deal {Source d8} damage vs Str, if the attack was Ranged, target an enemy range 6 and deal {Source d6} damage vs Dex.",B.K,B.acK,!1)
