B.Zg=new A.r("feature_vow_My_Vengeance","My Vengeance","While Concentrating, you deal {Source/3} d8 bonus damage to any enemy that has damaged the target of your vow in this situation.")
B.TT=new A.r("feature_vow_My_Friends","My Friends","You may target any number of your allies.")
B.Uh=new A.r("feature_vow_My_Heart","My Heart","While concentrating, you give half of the healing and shield you receive to your vow target, reducing your healing and shield by the same amount. If you or your vow target die, the other must make a Will Defense, On Success they take {Half Vitality d12} damage. On Problems, they take {Vitality d12} damage.")
B.aas=s([B.Vc,B.Yv,B.Zg,B.TT,B.Uh],t.U)
B.a_R=new A.am("feature_vow","Vow","[Reaction] During your Turn, or Start of the Encounter, target 1 of your allies and begin concentrating on your vow. While concentrating, the target has resistance to all damage and you take an equal amount of damage whenever they take damage. Damage from your vow doesn\u2019t require you to make concentration checks. \n\n[Action] Target 1 of your allies and begin concentrating on your vow.\n",B.az,B.aas,!1)
B.UG=new A.r("feature_wall_of_shields_Champion","Champion","You automatically succeed on concentration checks caused by attacks against your allies and you gain resistance to damage from attacks that targeted your allies.")
B.TQ=new A.r("feature_wall_of_shields_Empowered","Empowered","You and your allies adjacent to the wall gain {Half Source} bonus range on attacks.")
