B.a_h=new A.am("feature_wall_of_shields","Wall of Shields","[Action] Summon {Source} spaces worth of shield walls in free spaces that are connected to your space. The walls last as long as you remain concentrating. Characters cannot move through the walls but may dash over. Whenever your wall is attacked, you are attacked instead. When a character targets an ally on the other side of the wall or the ally is adjacent to the wall, you may have the attack instead target your wall. While concentrating, you are restrained and at the end of your turn you gain {Source d6} shield.\n\n[Reaction] During your or a willing ally's turn, spend your reaction. Perform your shield wall using the triggering ally instead of yourself. You concentrate on the wall instead of the target. The target may stop the wall at any time.",B.az,B.ab4,!1)
