B.Y3=new A.r("feature_wave_Tsunami","Tsunami","On Success, all enemies adjacent to you are also pushed. The distance of the push is increased by {source}.")
B.acE=s([B.Tt,B.Xw,B.Y3],t.U)
B.a_c=new A.am("feature_wave","Wave","[Action] target all enemies within a {Source}x{Source} box with at least 1 space adjacent to you and Make an Melee Attack vs Str. On success, deal {Source d8} damage and push them up to {Source} in the same direction.\n\n[Reaction] when you or an ally range {Source} succeeds a defense, Spend your reaction, and target all enemies within {Half Source} of the Triggering character. Deal {Half Source d8} damage vs Str and push them up to {Source} in the same direction.",B.K,B.acE,!1)
B.Vn=new A.r("feature_weapon_attack_Charge","Charge","Before making a Melee Weapon attack, Move up to {2*Source} in a straight line toward the target. If you moved at least 2 spaces, gain a +1 to the attack result.")
