B.a_k=new A.am("feature_whirlwind","Whirlwind","[Action]: Make a Melee attack vs Dex Targeting enemies range 2. On Success, deal {Source d6} damage, and you may dash any enemies in range to a free space in range. \n\n[Reaction] When you succeed on attack or when an ally fails with their action, spend your reaction and target all enemies range 2, and deal {Half Source d6} damage vs Dex, and you may dash any enemies in range to a free space in range.",B.K,B.abl,!1)
B.VH=new A.r("feature_wreath_of_flames_Bonfire","Bonfire","Increase the range of the status check to {1 + Half Power}.")
B.WF=new A.r("feature_wreath_of_flames_Living_Inferno","Living Inferno","The target gains {Half Source} d6 Burn vs Dex. If you target an ally, they have {Half Source} d12 regeneration as long as they have this burn.")
B.Uw=new A.r("feature_wreath_of_flames_Thorn_Wreath","Thorn Wreath","Whenever the target fails a melee defense, both the target and the attacker gain {Half Source} d6 Burn vs Dex. Allies do not gain this burn.")
