B.JS=new A.d0("biomorph","Biomorph","",0,!1,null,"{Half Level} Times per story, you may ooze through any door, window, or gap.","You always have at least {Half Vitality}d6 Regeneration. [Reaction] After taking damage from an attack or status check, You spend your reaction deal {Half Level d6} damage to enemies range 1 and heal {Level/3 d6} per enemy targeted.",B.acf,null)
B.JB=new A.h2("Cold","Combat: Give the targets {Level /3} Cold. Adventuring: Freeze a surface or the floor of a room making it slippery.","Give the targets {Level /3} Cold.","Freeze a surface or the floor of a room making it slippery.")
B.Jx=new A.h2("Fire","Combat: Give the targets {Half Level} d6 Burn. Adventuring: Touch an object causing it to burst into flames.","Give the targets {Half Level} d6 Burn.","Touch an object causing it to burst into flames.")
B.Jy=new A.h2("Acid","Combat: The attack ignores shield and resistance. Adventuring: Dissolve a chair sized object with acid.","The attack ignores shield and resistance.","Dissolve a chair sized object with acid.")
B.JD=new A.h2("Wind","Combat: After attacking, Dash you and the targets of the attack up to {Half Level} in the same direction. Adventuring: Cause a gust of wind strong enough to knock a person over for a few seconds.","After attacking, Dash you and the targets of the attack up to {Half Level} in the same direction.","Cause a gust of wind strong enough to knock a person over for a few seconds.")
B.Jv=new A.h2("Water","Combat: Until the start of your next turn, your allies deal {Half Level} d6 extra damage on attacks or damaging Status Checks against the targets. Adventuring: After an ally fails a check, give them some water and they gain a +1 to all checks to solve the problem caused by their check.","Until the start of your next turn, your allies deal {Half Level} d6 extra damage on attacks or damaging Status Checks against the targets.","After an ally fails a check, give them some water and they gain a +1 to all checks to solve the problem caused by their check.")
B.JC=new A.h2("Earth","Combat: The target's speed is reduced by {Half Level}. Adventuring: You can move 4 cubic meters of dirt and stone and can use a create skill to form it into anything that could be made of either.","The target's speed is reduced by {Half Level}.","You can move 4 cubic meters of dirt and stone and can use a create skill to form it into anything that could be made of either.")
B.Jz=new A.h2("Death","Combat: Deal the damage of the attack to an untargeted enemy range 6 of one of the targets. Adventuring: Ask 3 questions of a recently dead body, the body answers truthfully but only what it experienced since it was spawned.","Deal the damage of the attack to an untargeted enemy range 6 of one of the targets.","Ask 3 questions of a recently dead body, the body answers truthfully but only what it experienced since it was spawned.")
B.JE=new A.h2("Life","Combat: Target an ally range 3 and heal them {Half Level d6}. Adventuring: Treat 1 exhaustion.","Target an ally range 3 and heal them {Half Level d6}.","Treat 1 exhaustion.")
B.Jw=new A.h2("Lightning","Combat: Target all enemies within 3 of any of the targets excluding the targets. Deal {Half Level d6} damage to all prone enemies and otherwise knock them prone. Adventuring: Zap a person or device with electricity momentarily stunning it.","Target all enemies within 3 of any of the targets excluding the targets. Deal {Half Level d6} damage to all prone enemies and otherwise knock them prone.","Zap a person or device with electricity momentarily stunning it.")
B.JA=new A.h2("Rainbow","Combat: Before the target makes an attack vs the chosen defense, they may choose to target any defense with a +1 to success. Adventuring: You may spend a usage to let yourself or allies you can see, reroll any skill or defense that was a d4 or d6, or if it is their lowest skill or defense rating.","Before the target makes an attack vs the chosen defense, they may choose to target any defense with a +1 to success.","You may spend a usage to let yourself or allies you can see, reroll any skill or defense that was a d4 or d6, or if it is their lowest skill or defense rating.")
B.JF=new A.h2("Weed","Combat: Before or after any of the other effects, place difficult terrain in the target's space. If there is already difficult terrain there, restrain them until the start of your next turn. Adventuring: Cause thorns to grow to cover the floor of a room or doorway.","Before or after any of the other effects, place difficult terrain in the target's space. If there is already difficult terrain there, restrain them until the start of your next turn.","Cause thorns to grow to cover the floor of a room or doorway.")
