B.azn=new A.bN("weapon_melee_Spear","Spear",B.at,"Deal {Half Source d6} extra damage against targets successfully attacked by one of your allies. Cheer[Reaction] On Success with a spear attack, you may spend your reaction and allies gain +1 to attack results against the target until the start of your next turn.","2","{Source d6}","{Source d8}","Str")
B.azo=new A.bN("weapon_melee_Punch_Shield","Punch Shield",B.at,"On Success, Either, Gain {Source d6} Shield, or you may reduce your shield by up to {Source} to increase the damage done by twice the amount lost.","1","{Source d6}","{Source d8}","Str")
B.azt=new A.bN("weapon_melee_Tower_Shield","Tower Shield",B.at,"On Success, Until the start of your next turn, you and allies within {Half Source} gain +1 to defenses caused by Ranged Attacks.  Block[Reaction] Before you or an Ally within {Half Source} is targeted by an attack, you may use your reaction to give Advantage on the Defense roll. If the attack targets multiple characters, any of them within {Half Source} also gain advantage on the Defense.","1","{Source d10}","{Source d12}","Str")
B.az6=new A.bN("weapon_melee_Assassin_Knife","Assassin's Knife",B.at,"If you are attacking while hidden, deal {Half Source d8} extra damage.","1","{Source d8}","{Source d10}","Dex")
B.azi=new A.bN("weapon_melee_Flail","Flail",B.at,"On Success, deal {Level /3 d12} extra damage. On Failure, Roll and deal the fail damage against yourself.","1","{Source d10}","{Source d12}","Str")
B.azm=new A.bN("weapon_melee_Fry_Pan","Fry Pan",B.at,"PreHeat: During your Turn, [Reaction] until the end of your turn, deal {Source d6} bonus damage on successful frypan attacks.","1","{Source d6}","{Source d8}","Str")
B.azj=new A.bN("weapon_melee_Scyth","Scyth",B.at,"On Success, You may reduce the number of damage dice you roll to give the target bleed of the same amount. Regardless, The first time until the start of your next turn, If a creature dies with bleed within {Source}, Heal {Vitality d12}.","2","{Source d10}","{Source d12}","Str")
B.azx=new A.bN("weapon_melee_Spoon","Spoon",B.at,"Scoop: When you Succeed on the Technique, Scoop the target. While scooped, they cannot make attacks of opertunity, and are restrained in a free space adjacent to you, and move with you. At the end of your turn, drop the target prone, in a free space in range of your techinque.\nFling: [Reaction] During your turn, make a ranged attack vs Dex targeting 1 enemy range 4/8. on success, deal {Source d6} bludgeoning damage. If you have a scooped enemy, Regardless of success, dash the scooped enemy to a free space within 1 of the target and drop them prone, On Success, also deal damage to the scooped enemy. ","1","{Source d8}","{Source d10}","Str")
B.azB=new A.bN("weapon_melee_Spiked_Whip","Spiked Whip",B.at,"+1 to attack results against targets with burn or bleed.\n Ripping: [Reaction] when an enemy in range of your spike whip, takes damage from burn or bleed or you or an ally succeed on a status check, spend your reaction and make a technique attack.","3","{Source d10}","{Source d12}","Dex or Wis")
B.azr=new A.bN("weapon_melee_Scissors ","Scissors",B.at,"On Success, until the start of your next turn, choose to either halve the targets speed or you and your allies have +1 to results on Str, Dex, or Vit defense caused by the target.","1","{Source d8}","{Source d10}","Str")
B.az1=new A.bN("weapon_melee_Twin_Blade","Twin Blade",B.at,"On Success, Either, Target all enemies range 1, or Target one enemy and make 2 attacks.","1","{Source d8}","{Source d10}","Dex")
B.az2=new A.bN("weapon_melee_Umbrella","Umbrella",B.at,"Float: After succeeding on a weapon attack, until the start of your next turn, At the start of each turn, dash {Source/3} to a free space.\nOpen[Reaction] Before you or an adjacent Ally is attacked by a Ranged Attack, you may use your reaction to give Advantage on the Defense Roll to you and all allies targeted by the attack.","1","{Source d8}","{Source d10}","Str")
B.az_=new A.bN("weapon_melee_Bubble_Shield","Bubble Shield",B.at,"On Success, Until your next turn, Allies within {Half Source} of you may use your shield when damaged.","1","{Source d8}","{Source d10}","Str")
B.azp=new A.bN("weapon_melee_Chainsaw","Chainsaw",B.at,"[Reaction] During Yours or an Enemies Turn: Start your chainsaw and begin concentrating: While Concentrating, on success with a chainsaw attack, give the target {Half Source} d6 bleed. You cannot use your chainsaw other than as an improvised weapon if its not started. Other creatures can start a chainsaw but must succeed a create skill.","1","{Source d10}","{Source d12}","Str")
B.az4=new A.bN("weapon_melee_Skateboard","Skateboard",B.at,"On Success, After dealing damage, Move {Source} this movement can cause Opportunity Attacks. Until the start of your next turn, You have advantage on defenses caused by opportunity attacks And the target of the attack must make an opportunity attack if able. This includes the movement from this technique","1","{Source d8}","{Source d10}","Dex")
B.az0=new A.bN("weapon_melee_Wrench","Wrench",B.at,"On Success, Either, Knock the target prone or, until the start of your next turn when an ally ends their turn adjacent to you, heal them {Source /3 d6}","1","{Source d8}","{Source d10}","Str")
